# Environment variables of Claude Code's container: its settings and secrets.
# Kept out of git (see .gitignore) and out of the image. `ansible-playbook deploy.yml`
# installs it on the servers, readable by root and the service's account only.
# One KEY=value per line, without quotes.
#
# Claude's sign-in: set one of the two (if both are set, the API key wins), or
# neither, and Claude signs in with a claude.ai account in its first session.
# A Pro, Max, Team or Enterprise subscription: the one-year token that
# `claude setup-token` prints, on any machine with a browser.
# CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=
# A Console API key:
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
